An arrow a highlight closes leaves its rest to read with what follows

```
=a<=>=b=
.
<p><mark>a&lt;</mark>≥b=</p>
```

```
=a ==>=b=
.
<p><mark>a =</mark>≥b=</p>
```

```
=a<=> =b=
.
<p><mark>a&lt;</mark>&gt; <mark>b</mark></p>
```

```
=a<=>*b*
.
<p><mark>a&lt;</mark>&gt;<strong>b</strong></p>
```
